<scheme version="2.0" title="Ch.8 reference-method errors (acetic acid NIR)" description="ch08_references.csv: water + 3 vinegars with label, two Atago readings, NaOH titration volume and the 1 mm 2258 nm second-derivative signal. Formula: titration acidity 0.2589 x V, mL needed for the label value and the gap in mL. Scatter plots of the signal vs each reference. Linear Regression (no regularisation) on titration vs titration x 0.97: slope changes by 1/0.97, R2 identical.">
